.TH geectl-person-search 1  "geectl-person-search 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-person\-search \- Search for a person: the OBS projects naming the login, and the Gitea users matching the keyword. With no `\-\-backend` both arms run, OBS first then Gitea
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl person search\fR [\fB\-\-backend\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIQUERY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search for a person: the OBS projects naming the login, and the Gitea users matching the keyword. With no `\-\-backend` both arms run, OBS first then Gitea
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-backend\fR \fI<BACKEND>\fR
Only search this backend (`obs` or `gitea`). With no backend both arms run, OBS first then Gitea
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
obs
.IP \(bu 2
gitea
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>
The query: an OBS login, a Gitea keyword
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
